# Components

- Add button/input/select/etc. via **shadcn CLI** → `components/ui`.
- Complex shared UI (not a single primitive) → `components/common`.
- Libraries (TipTap, etc.) for surfaces shadcn does not cover.
- Prefer `next/image`, `next/font`, and Next link/navigation primitives.
- Dynamic-import heavy feature UIs to keep bundles lean.
- TipTap setup is deferred; do not scaffold editor packages until that feature starts.
